    },
    {
      "slug": "past-time-expressions",
      "title": "Yesterday, last week, two days ago",
      "summary": "Say when something happened.",
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "sections": [
        {
          "kind": "learn",
          "title": "When did it happen?",
          "body_md": "- **yesterday** / **yesterday morning**\n- **last** + time: *last night, last week, last year* (no *the*)\n- time + **ago**: *two days ago, ten minutes ago*\n- **in** + year or month: *in 2019, in May*\n- **on** + day or date: *on Monday, on 3 March*\n\nThese words usually go at the end or the start of the sentence."
        },
        {
          "kind": "see",
          "title": "Examples",
          "body_md": "- *I started this job **three months ago**.*\n- ***Last summer** we went camping.*\n- *She was born **in** 2001.*\n- *I saw him **on** Tuesday.*"
        },
        {
          "kind": "try",
          "title": "Try it",
          "body_md": "Try it.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "ptx-try-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "I met her two years ___.",
              "options": [
                "ago",
                "last",
                "before"
              ],
              "answer": "ago",
              "hint": "Which word comes after the time?",
              "explanation": "Time + *ago*: *two years ago*."
            },
            {
              "id": "ptx-try-2",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "We moved here ___ year.",
              "options": [
                "last",
                "the last",
                "ago"
              ],
              "answer": "last",
              "explanation": "*last year* (no *the*)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "title": "Check",
          "body_md": "Answer the questions.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "ptx-check-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "The class finished ten minutes ___.",
