    {
      "slug": "present-continuous-now",
      "title": "Present continuous: happening now",
      "summary": "Say what people are doing at the moment.",
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "sections": [
        {
          "kind": "learn",
          "title": "am / is / are + -ing",
          "body_md": "We use the **present continuous** for actions happening **now** or around now.\n\n*I **am** read**ing**. She **is** cook**ing**. They **are** play**ing**.*\n\nSpelling: *make → mak**ing*** (drop *e*), *run → run**ning*** (double the consonant), *lie → l**ying***.\n\n**Negative:** *I'm not working. He isn't sleeping.*  **Question:** ***Are** you listen**ing**?*"
        },
        {
          "kind": "see",
          "title": "Look out of the window",
          "body_md": "*It **is raining**. A man **is running** for the bus. Two children **are playing** in the park. My neighbour **isn't working** today: she **is sitting** in her garden.*\n\nWords like *now, right now, at the moment, look!, listen!* often go with it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "try",
          "title": "Try it",
          "body_md": "Try it.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "pc-try-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "Be quiet! The baby ___.",
              "options": [
                "sleeps",
                "is sleeping",
                "sleeping"
              ],
              "answer": "is sleeping",
              "hint": "am / is / are + -ing",
              "explanation": "Happening now: *is sleeping*."
            },
            {
              "id": "pc-try-2",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "What is the -ing form of \"swim\"?",
              "options": [
                "swiming",
                "swimming",
                "swimeing"
              ],
              "answer": "swimming",
              "explanation": "Short verb, one vowel + one consonant: double it: *swimming*."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "title": "Check",
          "body_md": "Answer the questions.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "pc-check-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "They ___ TV right now.",
              "options": [
                "watch",
                "are watching",
                "watching"
              ],
              "answer": "are watching",
