    {
      "slug": "present-simple-vs-continuous",
      "title": "Present simple or present continuous?",
      "summary": "Choose between habits and things happening now.",
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "sections": [
        {
          "kind": "learn",
          "title": "Habit or now?",
          "body_md": "- **Present simple**: habits, routines and facts: *I **drink** coffee every morning.*\n- **Present continuous**: now or around now: *I**'m drinking** tea now.*\n\nClue words:\n- simple: *every day, usually, often, never, on Mondays*\n- continuous: *now, at the moment, today, this week*\n\nSome verbs are rarely used with -ing: *like, love, want, know, understand, need*: *I **want** a coffee* (not *I'm wanting*)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "see",
          "title": "Examples",
          "body_md": "- *Ali usually **walks** to work, but today he**'s taking** the bus.*\n- *Water **boils** at 100 °C.*\n- *I **know** the answer.*\n- *We**'re staying** with friends this week.*"
        },
        {
          "kind": "try",
          "title": "Try it",
          "body_md": "Try it.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "svc-try-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "She ___ to the gym every Tuesday.",
              "options": [
                "goes",
                "is going",
                "go"
              ],
              "answer": "goes",
              "hint": "Look for the clue word.",
              "explanation": "*every Tuesday* = a habit: present simple."
            },
            {
              "id": "svc-try-2",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "Look! It ___.",
              "options": [
                "snows",
                "is snowing",
                "snow"
              ],
              "answer": "is snowing",
              "explanation": "*Look!* = now: present continuous."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "title": "Check",
          "body_md": "Answer the questions.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "svc-check-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
