    {
      "slug": "will-predictions-offers",
      "title": "Will: predictions, offers and quick decisions",
      "summary": "Use will for the future when you decide now or guess.",
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "sections": [
        {
          "kind": "learn",
          "title": "will + verb",
          "body_md": "**will** (*'ll*) + base verb is the same for everyone: *I'll help, she'll help.*\n\nUse it for:\n- **quick decisions** made now: *The phone's ringing. I**'ll** answer it.*\n- **offers and promises**: *I**'ll** carry that bag for you. I **won't** tell anyone.*\n- **predictions** (what you think): *I think it **will** be sunny tomorrow.*\n\n**Negative:** *won't* (= will not)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "see",
          "title": "Examples",
          "body_md": "- *\"I'm cold.\" \"I**'ll** close the window.\"*\n- *Don't worry, I **won't** be late.*\n- *I think you**'ll** love this book.*\n- ***Will** you help me with this?*"
        },
        {
          "kind": "try",
          "title": "Try it",
          "body_md": "Try it.",
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "will-try-1",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "\"I haven't got any money.\" \"Don't worry, I ___ pay.\"",
              "options": [
                "'ll",
                "am going to",
                "pay"
              ],
              "answer": "'ll",
              "hint": "Did you decide just now?",
              "explanation": "A quick decision or offer made now: *I'll pay*."
            },
            {
              "id": "will-try-2",
              "type": "single_choice",
              "prompt": "Which is correct?",
              "options": [
                "She will comes.",
                "She will come.",
                "She wills come."
              ],
              "answer": "She will come.",
              "explanation": "*will* + base verb, no *-s*."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "title": "Check",
          "body_md": "Answer the questions.",
          "exercises": [
