    {
      "slug": "future-time-expressions",
      "title": "Tomorrow, next week, in two days",
      "summary": "Say when something will happen.",
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "sections": [
        {
          "kind": "learn",
          "title": "When will it happen?",
          "body_md": "- **tomorrow** / **tomorrow morning** / **the day after tomorrow**\n- **next** + time: *next week, next month, next year* (no *the*)\n- **in** + period: *in two days, in an hour* (= two days from now)\n- **soon**, **later**, **tonight**, **this evening**\n\nCompare: *two days **ago*** (past) and ***in** two days* (future)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "see",
          "title": "Examples",
          "body_md": "- *The shop opens **in** ten minutes.*\n- *I'll call you **tomorrow**.*\n- *We're going to Italy **next** month.*\n- *See you **later**!*"
        },
        {
          "kind": "try",
          "title": "Try it",
          "body_md": "Try it.",
          "exercises": [
